      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Did you by any chance leave a station with the invisible one before? Or does the world something with stations?\n\nI have seen this exat bug multiple times. where multiple people couldn't see me after leaving a station. It happens to me with avatar and world stations. Workaround is to hide and show the user. This is an old bug i reported a long time ago.",
